# ── Third-party clones ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 5.7 GB of other people's repositories, each with its own .git. They are
# reproducible from previewdeck/repos.tsv via bin/clone.sh, and nesting them
# here would either bloat this repo or silently become broken submodules.
previewdeck/repos/

# ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
previewdeck/.dd*/
previewdeck/.thumbs/
DerivedData/
build/
*.xcuserdatad/
xcuserdata/

# ── Generated captures and reports ────────────────────────────────────────
# 75 MB of screenshots and screen recordings, all regenerable with
# `deck shot` / `deck record` / `grab.sh`.
previewdeck/shots/
previewdeck/logs/
# Rebuilt from results.json + shots by `deck gallery`; 2 MB of embedded images.
previewdeck/gallery.html

# ── Local machine state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.xcresult
